      "value": "@{63691297469f06772579fe6f|full_name} I learned Udon# now and recreated my code in U#... in its most simplified version:\n\n`LocalPlayer.TeleportTo(TeleportPosition, LocalPlayer.GetRotation(), teleportOrientation, lerpOnRemote);`\n\nThe player is still sometimes randomly rotated slightly, but not consistently.",
